    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/be757af33d382472fa0aded9fb40327f.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/039de346e724f8eec49cb612a2e561d5.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/039de346e724f8eec49cb612a2e561d5.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/039de346e724f8eec49cb612a2e561d5.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump systems, scan planets, dodge danger, find a new home or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Answer distress calls, decode weird signals, or just fire first and ask later.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/7478cc7d4fc847076c86efe9dfe13ab5.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/7478cc7d4fc847076c86efe9dfe13ab5.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/7478cc7d4fc847076c86efe9dfe13ab5.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off pirates and freaks in tactical shootouts to keep your ship in one piece.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can charm your way out of trouble? Give it a shot, hotshot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/440e80116dd2878a1266e616ba007ed2.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/440e80116dd2878a1266e616ba007ed2.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/440e80116dd2878a1266e616ba007ed2.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send drones to dig while your crew scans asteroids, wrecks, and stations for juicy hotspots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low on supplies? Break junk down into something useful with the handy-dandy material converter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/08ff024ce11d7b609edb5c206551a43f.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/08ff024ce11d7b609edb5c206551a43f.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/08ff024ce11d7b609edb5c206551a43f.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your crew to creepy ships and uncharted planets. Explore, loot, or die horribly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give orders or micromanage. Either way, someone\u2019s getting spaced.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/5035dbeeec72611e42234a9303d117b4.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/5035dbeeec72611e42234a9303d117b4.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/5035dbeeec72611e42234a9303d117b4.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch the hull, reroute power, rebuild or repurpose sections. Your ship\u2019s survival depends on it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert and adapt ship sections to fit your evolving needs: turn probe bay into a triage extension, retrofit cryo-chambers, or jury-rig new defenses to survive whatever space throws at you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/af5475fead50e58f6c317f32238a7c9f.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/af5475fead50e58f6c317f32238a7c9f.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/af5475fead50e58f6c317f32238a7c9f.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign a scientist as a mechanic, or a pacifist as your soldier. It's your decision. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision of who to wake, how to respond, what to repair, shapes your story and your crew's fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/bf33aab1eab366c5e1029b39942e2b6b.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/bf33aab1eab366c5e1029b39942e2b6b.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/bf33aab1eab366c5e1029b39942e2b6b.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Commander, prematurely thawed from cryo-sleep and dumped into the bridge of humanity's last starship. With most of Earth's finest minds still frozen, a half-broken AI (A.R.K.) at your side, and resources dwindling by the minute, you must guide your desperate crew through a hostile galaxy in search of a new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle scarce supplies, respond to unpredictable events, and make gut-wrenching decisions as you chart a course through star systems teeming with danger, mystery, and darkly comedic disaster. Assign roles, repair systems, launch risky ground ops, and decide who's worth saving... or sacrificing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every button press could be the difference between survival and extinction. Humanity's last hope is in your hands... and your hands are probably shaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/bf6a206823067fa5679b95ad1bfdc081.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/bf6a206823067fa5679b95ad1bfdc081.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/bf6a206823067fa5679b95ad1bfdc081.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
