lore, loot, or die horribly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give orders or micromanage. Either way, someone\u2019s getting spaced.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/5035dbeeec72611e42234a9303d117b4.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/5035dbeeec72611e42234a9303d117b4.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/5035dbeeec72611e42234a9303d117b4.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch the hull, reroute power, rebuild or repurpose sections. Your ship\u2019s survival depends on it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert and adapt ship sections to fit your evolving needs: turn probe bay into a triage extension, retrofit cryo-chambers, or jury-rig new defenses to survive whatever space throws at you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/af5475fead50e58f6c317f32238a7c9f.poster.avif?t=1751767543\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/af5475fead50e58f6c317f32238a7c9f.webm?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805790/extras/af5475fead50e58f6c317f32238a7c9f.mp4?t=1751767543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign a